.TH XDELTA3-GUI 1 "August 2026" "xdelta3-gui" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xdelta3-gui \- graphical interface for creating and applying xdelta3 patches
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xdelta3-gui
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ file ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xdelta3-gui
is a Qt graphical interface for the
.BR xdelta3 (1)
binary delta tool. It can create a patch from source and target files or
apply a patch to a source file.
.PP
If
.I file
names an existing delta file, the application opens the Apply Patch tab and
selects that file as the patch to apply.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \--help
Display command-line help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \--version
Display version information and exit.
.SH FILES
The application stores window geometry, compression preferences, and recently
used directories with the Qt settings system.
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.B xdelta3
must be available in
.BR PATH .
The optional
.B progress
utility is used to improve progress reporting while creating patches.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xdelta3 (1)
